#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:5 402899e543584ba1b9a47ec6f7256a23
msgid "Setting the input shaping parameters"
msgstr "设置输入整形参数"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:7 6672723526c24a338219d4f1ea776721
msgid ""
"Copter has a set of parameters that define the way the aircraft feels to "
"fly. This allows the aircraft to be set up with a very aggressive tune but "
"still feel like a very docile and friendly aircraft to fly."
msgstr "ArduCopter提供了一组定义飞机飞行手感的参数。这使得飞机可以在具有非常激进调参的同时，飞起来仍然感觉非常温顺易控。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:9 9982121c190b49feac31eb00a46968e8
msgid "The most important of these parameters is:"
msgstr "这些参数中最重要的是："

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:11 4758426614434746a657b1a97411edd1
msgid ":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>`: desired maximum yaw rate in deg/s"
msgstr ":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>`：期望的最大偏航速率（单位：度/秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:12 744484af273e4476af07ef9d79fda5e3
msgid ":ref:`ANGLE_MAX <ANGLE_MAX>`:  maximum lean angle"
msgstr ":ref:`ANGLE_MAX <ANGLE_MAX>`：最大倾斜角"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:13 5f7d57621d584ec390442d37196f4324
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`: Pitch rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`：俯仰角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:14 189604b6d90c48cea8476855868d0ec5
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`: Roll rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`：横滚角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:15 1ebf6c8a59fe486985b3755713a171cf
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`: Yaw rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`：偏航角速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:16 5cbe047b5b2043dea398d1b42ae24611
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>`: Aircraft smoothing time"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>`：飞机平滑时间常数"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:17 6e0541577e654443bdd7f22b2bbab212
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC <ATC_INPUT_TC>`: Time to achieve 63% seady state pitch "
"and roll attitude. Mulitply by 3 to determine time to achieve steady state "
"attitude."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_INPUT_TC <ATC_INPUT_TC>`：达到63%稳态俯仰和横滚姿态所需时间。乘以3可得到达到稳态姿态所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:18 c8747ba4fba5466f8b7e9184d4c10f07
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE_TC <PILOT_Y_RATE_TC>`: Time to achieve 63% steady state "
"yaw rate. Multiply by 3 to determine time to achieve steady state rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE_TC <PILOT_Y_RATE_TC>`：达到63%稳态偏航速率所需时间。乘以3可得到达到稳态速率所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:21 07d3455ad307438f93d8a4eb60b0e0d2
msgid ""
"Autotune will set the :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` parameters to their maximum based on measurements done "
"during the Autotune tests. These values should not be increased beyond what "
"Autotune suggests without careful testing. In most cases pilots will want to"
" reduce these values significantly."
msgstr ""
"AutoTune将根据AutoTune测试期间的测量结果，将 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` "
"参数设置为其最大值。这些值在未经仔细测试的情况下不应超过AutoTune的建议值。大多数情况下，飞手会希望大幅降低这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:23 6e9b29fc80834fdf833843284d9eb1f5
msgid ""
"For aircraft designed to carry large directly mounted payloads, the maximum "
"values of :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`, :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` should be "
"reduced based on the minimum and maximum takeoff weight (TOW):"
msgstr ""
"对于设计用于携带大型直接安装载荷的飞机，:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` 的最大值应根据最小和最大起飞重量（TOW）进行缩减："

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:25 2043a54a38094e8ba461f8c7c77bbbb2
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:26 e53b549ee6f346b9b640e613ad85df50
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:27 5e80cab4e43f490c8b9d103b1351dd7d
msgid ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:29 43b2a909586e4be7bc5133eaa647dbff
msgid ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` should be set to be approximately 0.005 x "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` to ensure that the aircraft can "
"achieve full yaw rate in approximately half a second."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PILOT_Y_RATE<PILOT_Y_RATE>` 应设置为约0.005 x :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`，以确保飞机能在约半秒内达到最大偏航速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:31 f45efc574ac244d589105785abbe7a7e
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` may be increased to provide a very "
"smooth feeling on the sticks at the expense of a slower reaction time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC <ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` 可以增大，以牺牲较慢的响应时间为代价，提供非常平滑的摇杆手感。"

#: ../../source/docs/input-shaping.rst:33 56a3341379b7471b81359660cc3bbd2d
msgid ""
"Aerobatic aircraft should keep the :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`,"
" :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>` provided by autotune and reduce :ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` to achieve the stick feel desired by the pilot. For pilots"
" wanting to fly ACRO the following input shaping parameters can be used to "
"tune the feel of ACRO:"
msgstr ""
"特技飞机应保留AutoTune提供的 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`，并降低 :ref:`ATC_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<ATC_ANG_LIM_TC>` 以达到飞手期望的摇杆手感。对于希望飞行Acro模式的飞手，可以使用以下输入整形参数来调整Acro的手感："

